            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.41 — Ask is off for now</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Ask is switched off.</b> The Ask panel, ⌘E and asking from a new tab are off while Ask is being reworked. It'll come back once it's ready.</li>
<li><b>Everything else is the same.</b> Typing in a new tab searches or opens sites as usual.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
