            <title>1.1.40</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 11:12:39 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>52</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.40</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.40 — Ask looks things up</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Ask searches the web.</b> Questions the page can't answer — service times, opening hours, addresses, prices — are looked up on the web and the site's other pages, with sources you can open.</li>
<li><b>No more dead ends.</b> If the page doesn't say, Pane searches instead of stopping there, and follow-ups keep track of what you were asking about.</li>
<li><b>Cleaner answers.</b> No more stray "untrusted" markers or asterisks in replies.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/nategoyco/pane-browser/releases/download/v1.1.40/Pane-1.1.40.zip" length="4958836" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="goHPYJfaeiuIdg73QEJmByNoi155PqpkXCDdd05uqzd2K/+WKz7tny4r4J1ZbJ4iuudx8eXvcTwBe19hHo//CA=="/>
