            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.39 — A lighter Ask</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Ask no longer slows your Mac.</b> The glow and animations while Pane answers now take a fraction of the work, so the rest of your Mac stays quick while it writes.</li>
<li><b>Answers start sooner.</b> The on-device model starts loading the moment you open the panel.</li>
<li><b>Smoother text.</b> Answers flow in without the stutter on long replies.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
